This repository reproduces the VLDB 2022 paper:
Zero-Shot Cost Models for Out-of-the-box Learned Cost Prediction
by Benjamin Hilprecht and Carsten Binnig.

Original implementation: https://github.com/DataManagementLab/zero-shot-cost-estimation
Base commit: 9ceabbdd753b6ce0c21a23cd6e64214e60e1197c
The original Apache License 2.0 is retained in LICENSE.md.

Local modifications add Python/DGL compatibility, reproducible downloads,
short-run orchestration, independent evaluation checks, and collaboration
documentation. The model architecture and official hyperparameters are retained.
